Quite the apocalipse game i was looking for...
You will have to survive, find new people, look for supplies, make hard decisions, deal with the danger around the cities you explore, etc.
The sound quality is good, not something amazing 'cause it's a game based on 2D Desings;
The Graphics aren't amazing at all;
But...
You have a story;
You start with a family of 4 (2 adults and 2 childrens) and 1 pet;
And you will have to survive in the Hardcore way.
And expect having some heartbreaking moments during the game...
IT'S NOT a ending game (unless you die)
Rate: 6.2/10

