Let me be really forward: I love this game. It's an absolutely fantastic and enjoyable experience all the way up until you're surrounded by 4 people and the server lags for half a second and the game auto-kicks you for a framerate drop that lasted less than half a second 30 seconds before the end of the game yielding no rewards or experience.
Amazing Game;
